      "html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n<head>\n  <style>\n    body { font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; line-height: 2; padding: 60px; max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto; }\n    h1 { text-align: center; font-size: 24px; margin-bottom: 10px; }\n    .author { text-align: center; font-size: 14px; margin-bottom: 30px; }\n    .abstract { background-color: #f9f9f9; padding: 20px; margin: 30px 0; border: 1px solid #ddd; }\n    h2 { font-size: 18px; margin-top: 40px; }\n    .reference { margin-left: 30px; text-indent: -30px; }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <h1>Title of Research Paper</h1>\n  <div class=\"author\">\n    <p>Author Name<br>Institution Name</p>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"abstract\">\n    <h2>Abstract</h2>\n    <p>This section contains a brief summary of the research, methodology, and findings.</p>\n  </div>\n  <h2>1. Introduction</h2>\n  <p>Introduce the research topic and provide background information.</p>\n  <h2>2. Literature Review</h2>\n  <p>Review relevant previous research and studies.</p>\n  <h2>3. Methodology</h2>\n  <p>Describe the research methods and procedures used.</p>\n  <h2>4. Results</h2>\n  <p>Present the findings of the research.</p>\n  <h2>5. Discussion</h2>\n  <p>Analyze and interpret the results.</p>\n  <h2>6. Conclusion</h2>\n  <p>Summarize the research and its implications.</p>\n  <h2>References</h2>\n  <p class=\"reference\">Author, A. (2023). Title of Work. Publisher.</p>\n</body>\n</html>"
